isks related to online learning and GDPR compliance, which we mitigate by using offline quarterly fine-tuning on anonymized data * Dependence on the quality of the knowledge base and administrative procedures, which requires regular updates and maintenance Overall, we proposed solution leverages we strengths in LLMs, RAG, and explainability to provide a powerful intelligent assistance tool for administrative activities, while acknowledging and mitigating potential risks." ;
